# Dataset input for RDFLib__VocPrez__vocprez_source_file.py__File_get_top_concepts:
# exercises the FALLBACK query (len(tcs) == 0), whose `GRAPH ?g { ... }`
# branch needs a dataset to evaluate at all.  The repository itself always
# passes a plain Graph (see driver.py), so this file exists only to compare
# the two versions of the fallback query's text.
#
# ex:scheme3 has no skos:hasTopConcept / skos:topConceptOf in the DEFAULT
# graph, so the first query finds nothing.  The fallback then reads:
#   - in the default graph (second UNION branch): a skos:inScheme member;
#   - in the named graph ex:ng (GRAPH ?g branch): a skos:hasTopConcept
#     concept and two skos:inScheme members, one with a no-language label;
# plus neighbours that must not match: a concept pointing at the scheme
# with another predicate (skos:related in the default graph,
# skos:topConceptOf -- which the fallback does not read -- in the named
# one; the default graph cannot hold skos:topConceptOf, the first query
# would find it), the scheme with skos:member, another scheme, and a label
# in another language.
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/> .

ex:k1 skos:inScheme ex:scheme3 .
ex:k1 skos:prefLabel "Kilo"@en .
ex:k6 skos:inScheme ex:scheme3 .
ex:k6 skos:prefLabel "Mike" .
ex:k7 skos:inScheme ex:scheme3 .
ex:k7 skos:prefLabel "November"@de .
ex:d1 skos:related ex:scheme3 .
ex:d1 skos:prefLabel "Decoy related"@en .
ex:scheme3 skos:member ex:d2 .
ex:d2 skos:prefLabel "Decoy member"@en .
ex:d3 skos:inScheme ex:scheme4 .
ex:d3 skos:prefLabel "Decoy other scheme"@en .

ex:ng {
    ex:scheme3 skos:hasTopConcept ex:k2 .
    ex:k2 skos:prefLabel "Lima"@en .
    ex:k3 skos:inScheme ex:scheme3 .
    ex:k3 skos:prefLabel "Juliet"@en .
    ex:k3 skos:prefLabel "Juliette"@fr .
    ex:k8 skos:inScheme ex:scheme3 .
    ex:k8 skos:prefLabel "Oscar" .
    ex:d4 skos:topConceptOf ex:scheme3 .
    ex:d4 skos:prefLabel "Decoy named top concept of"@en .
    ex:scheme3 skos:member ex:d5 .
    ex:d5 skos:prefLabel "Decoy named member"@en .
    ex:other skos:hasTopConcept ex:d6 .
    ex:d6 skos:prefLabel "Decoy named other scheme"@en .
}
